Z||000018||85Josh||03-19-2001||10:11 PM||||Philphine, if you figure out the rears, I can probably redrill a set of front rotors to a 5x115mm pattern, I'll have to get my hands on one to check. The only problem that comes to mind is interference between the lugbolt heads and the inside of the rotor. There may not be enough meat between existing holes, but if you decide to pursue this, I'm willing to check it out. After all, we Louisville Fiero freaks have to stick together! <P>------------------<BR>85 2M4<BR>CAVALRY SCOUT!(stuck in Field Artillery)||||reg||1
